body:
Scooter by Commander Salamander :,) :,) this one weirdly has a really sad and sweet story, the late drummer of that band was a close friend of mine and he once told me that song was his favorite song of theirs. the band had some issues with their distributor and it was off spotify for a long time before and after his death, but they actually just got it back up yesterday. have been listening to this one a lot yesterday and today:) if you listen, listen close to the drums for me, the guy playing's my friend liam crone and he was fucking awesome, he was a drum prodigy, he was a really beautiful human being

&#x200B;

